  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food Security and Rural Development - Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote income-generating activities through Farmer Business Schools, establishing village level demonstration farms that promote climate resilent agriculture techniques and sustainable environmental practices, capacity building on new business creation and expansion, and introducing innovative mechanization in production/post-harvesting processes. Special attention will be given children, youth mothers of pre-school children and people living with disabilities (PLWD).</narrative>
  </description>
